invariant: INV-5
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: the chain call reads its file under the bundle's text rule, so
  the call skips text before, between and after a chain's blocks. The
  ruling keeps the chain and key files strict, as pem_decode_certificate's
  file is (docs/decisions.md 131). test_chain_grammar's text rows object.

--- old
    pem_blocks_init(&blocks, pem, pem_len, PEM_TEXT_REFUSED);
--- new
    pem_blocks_init(&blocks, pem, pem_len, PEM_TEXT_SKIPPED);
